        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>HTML-escape a string or object

This converts any non-string objects passed into it to strings
(actually, using ``unicode()``).  All values returned are
non-unicode strings (using ``&amp;#num;`` entities for all non-ASCII
characters).

None is treated specially, and returns the empty string.
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
